    "result_text": "All 268 tests pass, including the new `Cp09Tests`. \n\nThe change is complete. To assign each newly created owner a sequential membership number:\n\n- **`Owner` entity** \u2014 added a persisted `Integer membershipNumber` field (`membership_number` column) with getter/setter.\n- **Schema** \u2014 added a `membership_number` column to the owners table in all four DB schemas (hsqldb, h2, mysql, postgres).\n- **OpenAPI** \u2014 added a read-only `membershipNumber` integer field to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` carries it and MapStruct maps it automatically (returned by both `POST` and `GET`).\n- **New function step** `AssignOwnerMembershipNumber` \u2014 sets `membershipNumber = ownerRepository.findAll().size() + 1` (one more than the current owner count).\n- **`owners.POST.yml`** \u2014 wired the new step into the pipeline between the uniqueness checks and `save`, under the same `transaction` governance, so it commits with the rest of the creation.",
